config BR2_PACKAGE_OCTOPUS_APPS
	bool "octopus-apps"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBOCTOPUS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBCURL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_MPG123
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FAAD2
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_AFTER_DARK_TOASTERS	# octopus-toasters' pictures
	help
	  The Chumby One's system apps, on liboctopus: Clock (with alarms,
	  rung by octopus-shell), FM Radio (uses /usr/bin/radio from the
	  falconwing-mainline board), AirPlay (what shairport-sync
	  receives; the board selects shairport-sync), Settings, and the
	  stream player octopus-stream (MP3 and AAC streams, HLS, files: for
	  any app, through liboctopus's octopus_stream_*). And Flying
	  Toasters, the screen saver octopus-shell starts after a while
	  without a touch.

	  Apps that aren't the system's - Internet Radio, Podcasts - are
	  bundles: octopus-bundled-apps.
